; delta-grammar for S1 -> S2: the Strata surface gains what a dependent type
; needs to be written down. A data declaration may carry a telescope, a
; constructor may declare the index it lands on, and a function type may bind
; its argument. Everything S1 could write still parses.
(change
  (kind delta-grammar)
  (name "S1->S2 delta-grammar")
  (replace
    (ReplaceChange
      strata-syntax
      (present [module version data def law match case let end])
      (present [module version data def law match case let end telescope index bind]))))
